    "summary": "Use it in your Movement phase on 1 **ADEPTUS ASTARTES TRANSPORT** unit of yours not yet chosen to move this phase. For the rest of the phase, its **Normal moves** and **Advance moves** can cross **terrain features** horizontally.\n\nIf it is a **HEAVY TRANSPORT**, those moves also gain the following:\n\n- They can cross enemy models that are not **MONSTERS** or **VEHICLES**.\n- They can come within **Engagement Range** of those models but must end outside it.\n- Any **Desperate Escape test** taken during them counts as passed.",
